            <summary>
              <p>This is a MS held ad the Prajna Pathashala Mandala in Wai, Sattara. This is a multiple-text manuscript, containing at least three different codicological units. </p>
              <p>Folios 1-30 contain the text of the <title xml:lang="sa-lang">Dhātupāṭha</title> edited (<term xml:lang="sa-latin">pavita</term>) by <persName xml:lang="sa-latin">Bhīmasena</persName>. It is complete and contains 30 folios.</p>
              <p>Folios 31-66 are written by a different hand and contain the text of the <title xml:lang="sa-latin">Gaṇapāṭhavivṛti</title>. The text is incomplete, as it misses some text in the beginning and in the middle. The foliation continuous from the preceding codicological unit and must have been added by a later hand.</p>
              <p>Folios nr. 42-47 contain an unidentifed text on phonetics (<term xml:lang="sa-latin">śikṣā</term>.</p>

            </summary>

